      "writtenOn": "2026-08-04T17:58:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the thing is, if you are calling Eigen::SparseQR to compute the decomposition anyways? then why use Intel at all? you have already done a QR factorization at that point, redoing it using Intel just does the work all over again..",
